===Etymology===
First attested in 1625. From regional {{bor|en|it|ditto}}, variant of {{m|it|detto}}, past participle of {{m|it|dire||to say}}, from {{der|en|la|dīcō||to say, to speak}}. Not related to {{noncog|en|dittography}}.

The specific meaning of making copies of paper comes from {{m|en|ditto machine}}, a [[genericization]] from the [[brand name]] of a [[spirit duplicator]].

